<view class="page"><view class="title">你的看房清单</view><view class="hint">模板仅用于之后新建的房源，不改动已有检查结果。基础信息与条件控制项保留。</view><view class="chips"><button class="chip {{mode==='完整'?'selected':''}}" data-value="完整" bindtap="mode">完整 · 303 项</button><button class="chip {{mode==='自定义'?'selected':''}}" data-value="自定义" bindtap="mode">自定义 · {{selectedCount}} 项</button></view><view class="space"/><input placeholder="搜索检查项" value="{{query}}" bindinput="search"/><view class="space"/><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="title" class="card"><view class="row between" data-value="{{item.title}}" bindtap="fold"><text class="subtitle">{{item.title}}</text><text>{{expanded===item.title?'⌃':'⌄'}}</text></view><block wx:if="{{expanded===item.title||query}}"><view wx:for="{{item.fields}}" wx:for-item="field" wx:key="id" class="menu" data-id="{{field.id}}" bindtap="toggle"><text class="grow">{{field.label}}<text wx:if="{{field.required}}" class="muted"> · 保留</text></text><view class="check {{field.checked?'on':''}}">{{field.checked?'✓':''}}</view></view></block></view><button class="primary" bindtap="save">保存默认模板</button></view>
